                </zone-style>
              </zone>
              <zone h='21159' id='85' type-v2='empty' w='92439' x='3773' y='72763'>
                <zone-style>
                  <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                  <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                  <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                  <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                </zone-style>
              </zone>
              <zone forceUpdate='true' h='35857' id='210' type-v2='text' w='92439' x='3773' y='9286'>
                <formatted-text>
                  <run bold='true' fontcolor='#1b1b1b' fontsize='12'>Purpose</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#1b1b1b' fontsize='10'>The dashboard was created to provide an overview of the main KPIs for Tech and Product departments.</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#1b1b1b' fontsize='10'>It was requested by Tobias Heuer.</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;&#10;&#10;</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#1b1b1b' fontsize='10'>1 - Global Tech and Product KPIs</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#1b1b1b' fontsize='10'>This view provides an overview of the selected KPIs on a company level down to cost center level as well. The user can select each metric and visualise it in terms of progression over time globally, on a company level and in terms of companies&apos; relative sizes during last month.</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#1b1b1b' fontsize='10'>2 - Vertical</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#1b1b1b' fontsize='10'>This view provides an overview of the selected KPIs on a vertical level down to cost center level. The user can select each metric and visualise it in terms of progression over time globally, on a vertical level and in terms of verticals&apos; relative sizes during last month.</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#1b1b1b' fontsize='10'>3 - Platform</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#1b1b1b' fontsize='10'>This view provides an overview of the selected KPIs on a platform level down to cost center level. The user can select each metric and visualise it in terms of progression over time globally, on a platform level and in terms of platforms&apos; relative sizes during last month.</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#1b1b1b' fontsize='10'>4 - Location</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#1b1b1b' fontsize='10'>This view provides an overview of the selected KPIs on a company location level down to cost center level. The user can select each metric and visualise it in terms of progression over time globally, on a location level and in terms of locations&apos; relative sizes during last month.</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#1b1b1b' fontsize='10'>5 - List of Cost Centers</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#1b1b1b' fontsize='10'>This view provides a list of Cost Centers labelled into Tech and Product departments and the platform and vertical they belong to. For Talabat, we do not use Cost Centers, rather we get all employees below CTO and CPO.</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                </formatted-text>
                <zone-style>
                  <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                  <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                  <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                  <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                </zone-style>
              </zone>
              <zone h='27620' id='295' type-v2='text' w='92439' x='3773' y='45143'>
                <formatted-text>
                  <run bold='true' fontcolor='#1b1b1b' fontsize='12'>Definitions</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;&#10;&#10;</run>
                  <run bold='true' fontcolor='#1b1b1b' fontsize='10'>Scale the tech team</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#1b1b1b' fontsize='10'>Actual HC: Number of employees in a given month</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#1b1b1b' fontsize='10'>Net Addition: Difference between starters and leavers in a given month</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#1b1b1b' fontsize='10'>Starters: Number of employees whose first day of work lies in a given month</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#1b1b1b' fontsize='10'>Leavers: Number of employees whose last day of work lies in a given month</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#1b1b1b' fontsize='10'>Hires: Number of employees whose hire date lies in a given month</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#1b1b1b' fontsize='10'>Initiated Terminations: Number of employees whose termination has been initiated in a given month</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                  <run bold='true' fontcolor='#1b1b1b' fontsize='10'>Ensure the high bar</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#1b1b1b' fontsize='10'>Avg Interview Rating: Average rating provided during the interview of candidates whose first day of work lies in a given month. The range is from 1 (&quot;Strong Yes&quot;) to 3 (&quot;No&quot;)</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                  <run bold='true' fontcolor='#1b1b1b' fontsize='10'>Organizational Health</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#1b1b1b' fontsize='10'>Initiated Attrition: Ratio of initiated terminations over actual HC in a given month</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#1b1b1b' fontsize='10'>Product to Tech Ratio: Ratio of employees in Product over employees in Tech</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#1b1b1b' fontsize='10'>M to IC Ratio: Ratio of employees in management track over employees in IC track</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#1b1b1b' fontsize='10'>Female Ratio: Ratio of female employees</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#1b1b1b' fontsize='10'>IC456 to IC123 Ratio: Ratio of employees in IC4, IC5, IC6 over employees in IC1, IC2, IC3</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#1b1b1b' fontsize='10'>Average eNPS: Average NPS in a given month. If null, the previous non null value is taken</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                  <run bold='true' fontcolor='#1b1b1b' fontsize='10'>Engagement</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#1b1b1b' fontsize='10'>Percentage of detractors: Ratio of detractors (eNPS below 6) over all employees</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#1b1b1b' fontsize='10'>Voluntary Initiated Attrition: Ratio of voluntary initiated terminations over actual HC in a given month</run>
                </formatted-text>
                <zone-style>
                  <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                  <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                  <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                  <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                </zone-style>
              </zone>
            </zone>
          </zone>
          <zone-style>
            <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
            <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
            <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
            <format attr='margin' value='8' />
          </zone-style>
        </zone>
